---
title: SD-06 Sales - Void Sale
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor AD as Administrator
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Sales API
    participant S as SalesService
    participant D as SQL Server
    AD->>F: Select sale + enter void reason
    F->>A: POST /api/sales/{id}/void (JWT)
    A->>A: Authorize role = Administrator
    A->>S: VoidSale(id, reason, adminId)
    S->>D: BEGIN TRANSACTION, load Sale + SaleItemBatches
    D-->>S: Sale data
    alt Already voided or reason missing
        S->>D: ROLLBACK
        S-->>A: Business error
        A-->>F: 400 + message
        F-->>AD: Show error
    else Valid
        S->>D: Set Status = Voided, VoidedAt, VoidedByUserId, VoidReason
        S->>D: Restore QuantityRemaining on the original batches
        S->>D: Insert reversing StockMovements (Void, +qty)
        S->>D: COMMIT
        S-->>A: Voided sale
        A-->>F: 200 OK
        F-->>AD: Show voided status
    end
    Note over S,D: Restored stock in an expired batch stays excluded from available stock
